+ *  what they meant.
+ *
+ *  This is a hand-rolled `indexOf` scan, not the regular expression it used
+ *  to be (`/'((?:[^']|'')*)'/g`). The expression was exact but a regex
+ *  engine keeps a backtracking choice per repetition of that group, so a
+ *  single ~15-million-character literal -- which a WRITE of a full TEXT /
+ *  STRING row hands straight through -- exhausted the engine's stack and
+ *  the statement died with `RangeError: Maximum call stack size exceeded`
+ *  (measured 2026-10-11). The scan below keeps the expression's rule,
